cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Tool-Result Errors in Language-Model Agents: A Fixed-Prefix Causal Study"
abstract: >-
  Pre-confirmatory research software for a fixed-prefix causal study of how the
  content of a real tool observation changes a language-model agent's next
  decision, and how quickly the agent recovers over four steps. The repository
  provides the scaffold, configuration, schemas, and governance documents for
  the ToolResult-800 harvest pipeline, perturbation renderer, calibration and main-run
  harnesses, and analysis code; pipeline entry points are stubs in version
  0.1.0. No confirmatory results are reported; the pilot is N=60 and is a
  screening signal, not a dose-response law.
